meta {
  name: 02 Exercises
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  # GET /exercises

  The fixed exercise catalog (ADR 0004), sorted by name, each with its muscle groups sorted by name.
  The API never creates exercises: `exerciseName` in every other endpoint must match one of these names
  (trimmed, case-insensitive), and responses return the canonical spelling.

  ```json
  {
    "data": [
      { "name": "Back Squat", "muscleGroups": ["glutes", "hamstrings", "quadriceps"] },
      { "name": "Barbell Row", "muscleGroups": ["back", "biceps"] }
    ]
  }
  ```

  Muscle groups: back, biceps, calves, chest, core, glutes, hamstrings, quadriceps, shoulders, triceps.
}
